y maintenance state history</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">State</th><th scope="col">Version</th><th scope="col">Changed</th></tr></thead><tbody>{history.map((item)=><tr><th scope="row">{item.action}</th><td>{stateLabel(item.state)}</td><td>{item.recordVersion.toString()}</td><td>{item.changedAt.toLocaleString('en-SA',{timeZone:'Asia/Riyadh'})}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table> : <p class="muted">History is unavailable or empty in your authorized scope.</p>}<p>Starting maintenance can put the equipment under maintenance transactionally. Completion does not return equipment to service or prove calibration; those are separate controlled decisions.</p><p class="muted">Created by {record.createdBy} · Updated {record.updatedAt.toLocaleString('en-SA',{timeZone:'Asia/Riyadh'})}</p></section></AppLayout>
